 # Reactions
 
-Reactions are short (16-character max) responses to comments.
+Reactions (also called boosts) are short (16-character max) responses to cards and comments.
+
+Card reactions and comment reactions share the same shape and behavior. Card reactions live under
+`/:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions` and comment reactions under
+`/:account_slug/cards/:card_number/comments/:comment_id/reactions`.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions`
+
+Returns a list of reactions on a card. The response has the same format as comment reactions below.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions`
+
+Adds a reaction to a card. Accepts the same parameters as comment reactions below and returns `201 Created` on success.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions/:reaction_id`
+
+Removes your reaction from a card. Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 
 ## `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/comments/:comment_id/reactions`
 
